# syncAwakeShaders' compiled output for awake:asset:shaders specifically -- unlike samples/*'s
# own appMain/wasmJsMain shader binaries (which ARE committed, real runtime assets), nothing
# consumes this module's own copy; it's a dead byproduct of a task registered on every module
# that applies awake.shader-pipeline-convention, this one included, regenerated on demand.
/awake/asset/shaders/src/appMain/
/awake/asset/shaders/src/wasmJsMain/
